'''First Round (Expert)''' is the second stage in [[The Proving Grounds]]. Beating this stage allows the access of two, random [[Continuation Stage]]s. The possible Continuation Stages include:
*[[2nd Round: Dawn (Expert)]]
*[[2nd Round: Dusk (Expert)]]

