==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Kory here is surprisingly weak, and the Hyppohs, even without any [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]], shouldn't pose that much of a threat. Still, it is wise to stall the beginning Doge variants for as much money as possible before attacking the base. If you are struggling with the Kory, it would be a good idea to bring [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and/or other [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] units, as those will even be able to help against the [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] in [[Last Round: Dawn (Deadly)]] and [[Last Round: Dusk (Deadly)]].

